.TH HH_CLIENT 1

.SH NAME
hh_client \- Interface to Hack language typechecker

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hh_client
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ DIRECTORY ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hh_client
checks Hack code for type errors. With no command specified, it checks the
project containing the current directory.

Run
.B hh_client \-\-help
for commonly used modes and options, or
.B hh_client \-\-ultrahelp
for the full list.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hh_server (1)
